      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ISA",
          "chapter": 7,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "“Ask a sign of the LORD your God; ask it either in the depth, or in the height above.”",
      "ko": "너는 네 하나님 여호와께 한 징조를 구하되 깊은데서든지 높은데서든지 구하라",
      "source_text_hash": "f111341031221392777965ccf57714b9789e4c9bde94ef5254a1f54d8baba2bd",
      "translation_text_hash": "a45cb82e5a765073b85e441bcef558c93c1882db582bd89355c15842b321ba21",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
